{
  "source": "Ticket 322 (Systems & Economy, 8 Oct 2026): the armoury numbers the GD decisions on #309 and #310 left open, read against their fixed values. Bore: #309 GD (range 4 at L1, cells 2 ticks apart, the 30-tick hold) with the GD amendment on #310 (rangeCap 10 cells, 6 range Marks) and the Vertical Scaler's shot budget (gun.shotDigTicks 90). Tracks: the Systems follow-up on #322 (one gap drives the rate track's kGunPct 25 to 45 and cooldown 45 to 15 over 11 levels; penetration 49% to 100% over 18; energy 198% to 100% over 15; each level at least 3% better) under the TD's recurrence gap(m+1) = gap(m) - max(1, floor(gap(m)/10)), and the locked re-pricing (a level costs oreUnits of band-5 ore at its target planet, as a tree node does, x1.225 for a second level on the same planet; rate ends at P11, penetration and energy at P10). Long barrel: holdStep 3, holdCap 15 (hold + warning stays under the 60-tick warning, so collapse always happens). Auto-shoot: reserve 10 points above the rescue floor, the 10-tick preview and the 60-tick manual wait (GD, floor 20). Bot: 60 shots per planet run per seed. Turret: gunRangeCap 10 tiles (TD), past the cap energy per shot x0.92 to its 0.5 floor. Modules: Content's placeholders (#310 node table), gun Marks on the income absorb limits, auto_guns Marks on the general ones. A slice's numbers live beside it (feature-slices.md 1.1).",
